Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Cassidy",
  "lastName": "Moonian",
  "email": "cassidy@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Organiser"
}

### Test Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cassidy@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Test Create Event
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Soweto Marathon 2026",
  "description": "Annual standard marathon event in Johannesburg.",
  "eventDate": "2026-11-01T06:00:00Z",
  "location": "Soweto, Johannesburg",
  "distance": 42.2,
  "eventType": "run"
}

### Test Get Events
GET http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Events
Accept: application/json

### 1. Login as Organiser (To establish session)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cassidy@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Create Category (Organiser only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "categoryName": "Senior 10km",
  "distanceKm": 10.0,
  "entryFee": 150.00
}

### 3. Register a New Participant
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Auth/Register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Runner",
  "email": "runner@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Participant"
}

### 4. Login as Participant (Switches the session role)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "runner@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5. Enrol in the Category (Participant only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 6. View My Enrolments
GET http://127.0.0.1:5101/api/Enrolments/my-enrolments
Accept: application/json